# PETAL PARADE: the jar economy doesn't saturate. The demo player plays the
# safe way (small drops, a jar only when there are brambles to clear), and
# with 8-second nectar it is powered well under half the run and wins far
# short of the 20,000 points the Alien needs.
seed 7
game petalparade
wait 20
botuntil state == 1 100
botuntil state != 1 30000
expect state == 4
expect powered_pct < 50
expect score < 20000
